# The animation graph of examples/37-character in the Graph panel (ADR 0211),
# while editing: its Body page; the blend across two parameters selected, with
# its plot; the list, asked for where nothing is; the state it adds, which
# nothing leads to; and an arrow drawn to it from another state's edge.
# Nothing is saved. Coordinates are a 1600 by 900 frame's.
wait 60
drag 700 607 700 820
wait 6
key ctrl+p
wait 8
text hero.animgraph
wait 10
key enter
wait 30
shot anim-editing
click 625 455
wait 6
shot anim-blend
rclick 480 650
wait 6
text sta
wait 6
shot anim-list
key enter
wait 8
move 700 760
wait 4
shot anim-unreachable
# From Fall's right edge to the new state.
drag 925 585 520 660
wait 8
move 700 760
wait 4
shot anim-arrow-made
quit
